- `tgraph.links(...)`, `tgraph.neighbors(node_id)`, `tgraph.paths(...)`, `tgraph.cidrs()`, `tgraph.ip_in_cidr(ip, cidr)`
- Formal `check_*`, `tgraph.issue(...)`, `tgraph.escalate(...)`

